# System Information

## uni.getSystemInfo / getSystemInfoSync

Get device and system information.

```javascript
// Synchronous (faster, recommended)
const info = uni.getSystemInfoSync()
console.log(info)

// Asynchronous
uni.getSystemInfo({
  success: (res) => {
    console.log(res)
  }
})

// Promise
uni.getSystemInfo().then(res => {
  console.log(res)
})
```

